---

<section class="border-t border-hairline bg-paper-deep/40">
  <div class="container-px section-pad">
    <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl">
      Which Chinese festival should you visit first?
    </h2>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <!-- primary answer -->
      <a
        href="#mid-autumn-festival"
        class="group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-field bg-vermilion p-7 text-paper transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 lg:col-span-2 lg:row-span-2"
      >
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-paper/70">Best all-round</p>
          <p class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight sm:text-4xl">Mid-Autumn, September</p>
          <p class="mt-4 max-w-[52ch] text-paper/85 leading-relaxed">
            The best scenery-to-crowd ratio of any festival. A full moon, mooncakes, and
            lanterns, without the New Year crush or the October Golden Week.
          </p>
        </div>
        <span class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-semibold">
          Read the guide
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </a>

      <!-- secondary answers -->
      <a
        href="#harbin-ice-festival"
        class="group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-field border border-hairline bg-white/60 p-6 transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-vermilion"
      >
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-vermilion">Most spectacular</p>
          <p class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink">Harbin Ice Festival</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
            A city built from ice and light, January into February.
          </p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a
        href="#water-splashing-festival"
        class="group flex flex-col justify-between rounded-field border border-hairline bg-white/60 p-6 transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-vermilion"
      >
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-vermilion">Most fun</p>
          <p class="mt-2 font-display text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink">Water Splashing</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
            The Dai New Year in Yunnan. Everyone gets soaked, April.
          </p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
